icon_check.png, icon_up.png and icon_down.png are the action bar icons from
PebbleOS (https://github.com/coredevices/PebbleOS), resources/*/base/images/
action_bar_icon_{check,up,down}.png, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
They have been recoloured from white to black for a transparent action bar.

menu_icon~color.png and menu_icon~bw.png are the launcher icon: the
25x25 keypad key with a zero (dial 0 for the operator), a 2px black wall
round a white face. The SDK picks the ~color file on colour watches and
the ~bw file on black-and-white ones. The firmware's launcher tints every
app icon by luminance (black on colour watches, inverted on the
highlighted row of black-and-white watches), keeping only black, dark
grey, light grey and white, so the colour version uses those greys to
smooth the corners and the bw version stays crisp.
